OL,3,GNEWSACommunity asked how #20m can best
OL,4,Ahelp area
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in part of Wolverhampton are
OL,7,Fbeing asked to consider how #20m in
OL,8,Fgovernment funding can best support the
OL,9,Fcommunity and improve the
OL,10,Fneighbourhood.
OL,12,FResidents and people working or
OL,13,Fstudying in Low Hill have been asked
OL,14,Fhow the money from the Pride in Place
OL,15,Fprogramme should be spent over the next
OL,16,Fdecade.
