OL,3,GNEWSACommunity asked how #20m can best
OL,4,Ahelp area
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe City of Wolverhampton Council's
OL,7,Fconsultation seeks views on what people
OL,8,Fvalue about the area, what they think
OL,9,Fneeds improving and which issues should
OL,10,Fbe given priority. It will help create
OL,11,Fa community-led regeneration and
OL,12,Finvestment plan.
OL,14,F"Your views will help create a plan
OL,15,Fthat reflects the real needs and
OL,16,Faspirations of the community," said
OL,17,Fcouncil leader Stephen Simkins.
